msgstr ""
"이 자동 매칭을 비활성화하고 자신이 정의한 라우트만 허용하려면 ``$autoRoute`` 속성을 false로 설정하면 됩니다:"

#: ../../source/incoming/routing.rst:735
msgid ""
"If you use the :doc:`CSRF protection </libraries/security>`, it does not "
"protect **GET** requests. If the URI is accessible by the GET method, the "
