msgid "404 Override"
msgstr "404 오버라이드"

#: ../../source/incoming/routing.rst:743
msgid ""
"When a page is not found that matches the current URI, the system will show "
"a generic 404 view. Using the ``$override404`` property within the routing "
"config file, you can define controller class/method for 404 routes."
msgstr ""
